# swift-bridge glue is regenerated by build.rs on every `cargo build` (the Swift host's
# build script produces it before linking), so it's a build artifact, not source.
/generated/
# The xcframework-backed Swift package emitted by the `create-package` bin (from the built
# .a + generated/) — a build artifact the mac/ SwiftPM host consumes by path.
/PbMacFfi/
